        "original_id": "35c5226f-9c5f-5aad-8ec4-e8b490ffa59a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nick Carter, Brady Seals, Avril Lavigne, Jordan Knight\n- Products: Now or Never, I'm Taking Off, All American, Nick & Knight, Play Time, Get Over Me\n- Organizations: Backstreet Boys, Star City\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, actor, dancer, country music artist\n\nFacts:\n- Nick Carter was born on January 28, 1980, and he is an American singer, songwriter, actor, and dancer.\n- Brady Seals was born on March 29, 1969, and he is an American country music artist.\n- Brady Seals released his fourth solo album, \"Play Time,\" in 2009 via Star City.\n- As of 2015, Nick Carter had released three solo albums: \"Now or Never,\" \"I'm Taking Off,\" and \"All American,\" during breaks in Backstreet Boys schedules.\n- As of 2015, Nick Carter had also released a collaboration with Jordan Knight titled \"Nick & Knight.\"\n- \"Get Over Me\" is a song by American singer and songwriter Nick Carter featuring Canadian singer Avril Lavigne.",
